export function american(decimal){if(decimal===null||decimal===undefined)return'—';try{const[n,d]=rational(decimal),a=n-d;if(a<=0n)return'—';const positive=n>=2n*d,num=positive?a*100n:d*100n,den=positive?d:a;const rounded=(num*2n+den)/(den*2n);return(positive?'+':'−')+rounded;}catch{return'—';}}
export function quoteText(q){return q?.display?.supported===false?'Conversion unavailable':q?.display?.american||'—';}
export function referenceOf(q){return[q?.sharp_reference,q?.calculations?.net_ev?.details?.reference,q?.calculations?.net_ev?.details?.natural?.details?.reference].find(ref=>ref&&(ref.selected_odds||ref.odds?.[ref.selected]))||{};}
export function grossMetric(q,fallback){return[q?.calculations?.ev,q?.calculations?.net_ev?.details?.gross_decisive_benchmark,fallback].find(metric=>metric?.eligible===true)||q?.calculations?.ev||fallback;}
